    "details": "<p>Test your <strong data-start=\"35\" data-end=\"94\">problem-solving, DSA, Java programming, and DBMS skills</strong> through a company-style Online Assessment. The challenge includes coding problems and technical MCQs designed to evaluate <strong data-start=\"217\" data-end=\"289\">logical thinking, technical fundamentals, and algorithmic efficiency</strong>.</p>\n<p><strong>Guidelines:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li data-section-id=\"qi1ppf\" data-start=\"15\" data-end=\"97\">The assessment consists of <strong data-start=\"44\" data-end=\"96\">2 coding questions, 2 DBMS MCQs, and 5 Java MCQs</strong>.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"13x82qg\" data-start=\"98\" data-end=\"176\">The coding questions will focus on <strong data-start=\"135\" data-end=\"175\">DSA, algorithms, and problem-solving</strong>.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"l37y80\" data-start=\"177\" data-end=\"309\">Candidates must carefully read the problem statement, input/output format, and constraints before attempting each coding question.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"g8arkl\" data-start=\"310\" data-end=\"396\">Coding solutions should be optimized to handle the given constraints and edge cases.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"117irn8\" data-start=\"397\" data-end=\"482\">MCQs will test conceptual understanding as well as practical programming knowledge.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"5k7ece\" data-start=\"483\" data-end=\"564\">Candidates should manage their time effectively across coding and MCQ sections.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1v1k0vv\" data-start=\"565\" data-end=\"628\">Hidden test cases may be used to evaluate coding submissions.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Rules:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li data-section-id=\"1wirj06\" data-start=\"640\" data-end=\"684\">The assessment duration is <strong data-start=\"669\" data-end=\"683\">60 minutes</strong>.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"m5u1z2\" data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"725\">Candidates must submit their own work.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1lahks2\" data-start=\"726\" data-end=\"819\"><strong data-start=\"728\" data-end=\"819\">Plagiarism, copying, or use of unauthorized external assistance is strictly prohibited.</strong></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1m6qoke\" data-start=\"820\" data-end=\"904\">Candidates must use only the programming language(s) permitted for the assessment.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"n7yk76\" data-start=\"905\" data-end=\"982\">Once the assessment time expires, submissions will be automatically closed.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"vd3oko\" data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"1065\">Candidates should ensure a stable internet connection throughout the assessment.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"11uw2u2\" data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"1185\">Any attempt to manipulate the assessment platform or bypass its evaluation system may result in <strong data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1184\">disqualification</strong>.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"13p1oyo\" data-start=\"1186\" data-end=\"1277\">The final score will be based on the correctness of coding submissions and MCQ responses.</li>\n</ul>",
